---
// Quest log — the career track on the landing page.
//
// One vertical rail instead of a separate full-bleed section per employer:
// the active quest (Archil) sits on top, and the completed ones (The Sandbox,
// 505 Games) sit under it, each closing with the thing that carried over into
// developer relations.
---

<section class="log" id="path" aria-labelledby="log-heading">
  <header class="log__head">
    <p class="log__kicker">// quest log</p>
    <h2 id="log-heading">How I got <em>here.</em></h2>
    <p class="log__lede">
      Game design taught me to explain systems. Forward-deployed engineering
      put me next to the developers using them. Developer relations is both.
    </p>
  </header>

  <ol class="log__rail">
    <!-- ============ ACTIVE: ARCHIL ============ -->
    <li class="quest quest--active" id="archil">
      <span class="quest__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <article class="quest__card">
        <header class="quest__meta">
          <span class="quest__status">● in progress</span>
          <span class="quest__when">2026 — now</span>
        </header>
        <h3 class="quest__title">Developer Relations <span>at</span> <em>Archil.</em></h3>
        <p class="quest__org">Archil · full-time</p>
        <p class="quest__body">
          The main quest. I work with the developers building on Archil:
          showing what the platform can do, getting them unstuck, and carrying
          what they run into back to the team.
        </p>
      </article>
    </li>

    <!-- ============ COMPLETE: THE SANDBOX ============ -->
    <li class="quest" id="sandbox">
      <span class="quest__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <article class="quest__card quest__card--split">
        <div class="quest__copy">
          <header class="quest__meta">
            <span class="quest__status">✓ complete</span>
            <span class="quest__when">2026 · contract</span>
          </header>
          <h3 class="quest__title">Forward Deployed Engineer <span>at</span> <em>The Sandbox.</em></h3>
          <p class="quest__org">The Sandbox · Creator Platform</p>
          <ul class="quest__list">
            <li>
              Primary technical point of contact for high-profile game creators
              integrating with the engine, APIs, and SDKs, from onboarding
              through stable integration.
            </li>
            <li>
              Debugged integration failures end to end: reproduced issues
              locally, isolated client code from platform behavior, and handed
              engineering actionable repro packages.
            </li>
            <li>
              Surfaced undocumented API behaviors and edge cases, and turned
              them into reports that drove SDK and documentation updates.
            </li>
            <li>
              Triaged creator-reported issues and feature gaps, and escalated
              the patterns across accounts to product and engineering.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="quest__carry">
            <span>carried over</span>
            Sitting with developers until their integration works, then fixing
            the docs so the next one doesn't hit it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="quest__media">
          <img src="/images/thesandbox.jpg" alt="The Sandbox Creator Platform" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
      </article>
    </li>

    <!-- ============ COMPLETE: 505 GAMES ============ -->
    <li class="quest" id="milan">
      <span class="quest__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <article class="quest__card quest__card--split">
        <div class="quest__copy">
          <header class="quest__meta">
            <span class="quest__status">✓ complete ×2</span>
            <span class="quest__when">summers 2024 + 2025 · milano</span>
          </header>
          <h3 class="quest__title">Game Design Intern <span>at</span> <em>505 Games.</em></h3>
          <p class="quest__org">505 Games · Avantgarden · <em>Among the Trolls</em></p>
          <ul class="quest__list">
            <li>
              Prototyped building and magic mechanics in UE5, plus 3 dungeon
              levels from modular pieces with smart wall and door behaviors.
            </li>
            <li>
              Owned quest and dialogue flow via the Narrative plugin: 12+
              quests and 12+ dialogue sequences with event-driven triggers.
            </li>
            <li>
              Authored ~7 Confluence specs with flowcharts and edge cases, and
              annotated mechanics in Figma, for engineering handoff.
            </li>
            <li>
              Worked daily in Italian across design, engineering, and QA.
              Relocated to Milan both summers.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="quest__carry">
            <span>carried over</span>
            Explaining a system clearly enough that someone else can build it,
            in two languages.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="quest__media quest__media--pair">
          <img src="/images/att.jpg" alt="Among the Trolls key art" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <img src="/images/505-summer-2025.jpg" alt="Milan, summer 2025" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
      </article>
    </li>

    <!-- ============ ORIGIN ============ -->
    <li class="quest quest--origin">
      <span class="quest__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="quest__origin">
        <strong>Start:</strong> B.S. Computer Science, Cal Poly Pomona, Dec 2025.
        Along the way: volunteering at GamesBeat Summit (LA, 2025) and the
        Crossfire Lounge (SF, 2026).
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .log {
    padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .log__head {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
  }

  .log__kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-strong);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .log h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
  }

  .log h2 em,
  .quest__title em {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .log__lede {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---------- RAIL ---------- */
  .log__rail {
    --rail-x: 9px;
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 0 clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
  }

  .log__rail::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--rail-x);
    top: 12px;
    bottom: 12px;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--border-strong);
  }

  .quest {
    position: relative;
  }

  .quest__node {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1 * clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px));
    top: 26px;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .quest--active .quest__node {
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--accent-soft);
    animation: quest-pulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes quest-pulse {
    0%, 60%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--accent-soft); }
    30% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px transparent; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .quest--active .quest__node { animation: none; }
  }

  /* ---------- CARD ---------- */
  .quest__card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 var(--ink);
  }

  .quest--active .quest__card {
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 0 var(--accent);
  }

  .quest__card--split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .quest__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .quest__status {
    color: var(--muted-strong);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  .quest--active .quest__status {
    color: var(--accent-2);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .quest__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .quest--active .quest__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
  }

  .quest__title span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .quest__org {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-strong);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .quest__body {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quest__list {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .quest__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .quest__list li::before {
    content: "▸";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .quest__carry {
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: none;
  }

  .quest__carry span {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* ---------- MEDIA ---------- */
  .quest__media {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .quest__media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  /* ---------- ORIGIN ---------- */
  .quest--origin .quest__node {
    top: 2px;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    left: calc(-1 * clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px) + 3px);
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  .quest__origin {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted-strong);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }

  .quest__origin strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .quest__card--split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .quest__media--pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .log__rail {
      --rail-x: 6px;
      padding-left: 28px;
    }
    .quest__node {
      left: -28px;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
    }
    .quest--origin .quest__node {
      left: -27px;
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
